  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"There are 125 copies of this book prominently press-numbered below. Different kinds of paper from Europe &amp; Japan were used, some hand made last summer here in Perry Township Usa by the printer's elder daughter"--Colophon; first letters of colophon lines form acrostic of title.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Includes 2 signatures of lithograph proofs.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The printer's "admission of structure" binding has the front board intentionally lacking linen cloth that covers spine and back board. Circular cut-out in front board frames part of a John Wilde painting ("Two golden delicious, one bitten") reproduced for the book.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="505" ind1="0" ind2=" ">
