  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="505" ind1="0" ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Paintings: Five early redbirds -- Two apples of love -- Four Dolgo crabs -- An ubiquitous mac -- Four autumn strawberries -- One and one-half Granny Smiths -- Four apples of the earth -- Three northwest greenings, one cut -- Two golden delicious, one bitten -- Four red romes ready for pie -- Two jonathans and one and one-half seedy apples -- View of Muskrat Lake with a great duchess rising -- Two Thalman sweets with a hinder light.</subfield>
